  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;direction:ltr;text-align:left;line-height:1.2;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Born in Korea, Made for All Beautykind.</span></p><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;margin:0px 0px 16px;\"><p style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos;font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">At LAPCOS, we blend the best of both worlds: the advanced science and heritage of Korean skincare with the creativity and sun-drenched spirit of Los Angeles. Our skincare, haircare, and bodycare are crafted to be both high-performance and joyfully approachable. From our best-selling</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;font-size:14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.lapcosusa.com/collections/dr-14-revitalizing-scalp-care\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Dr. 14 Revitalizing Scalp Care\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration:none;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-bottom:2px;\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Dr. 14 Vital Care Shampoo and Conditioner</a> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">to our cult-favorite, clinically validated</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;font-size:14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.lapcosusa.com/collections/masks\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Face &amp; Body Masks\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration:none;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-bottom:2px;\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">sheet masks</a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">, every. innovative formula is created to inspire curiosity, encourage self-expression, and deliver glow-inducing confidence.</span></p></div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different: K-beauty is certainly having a moment. But we have been around since 2017 with our best sellers like the Daily Collagen Mask. Tried and true formulations with a cult following. No trendy new ingredients and no fluff, just the good stuff. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Post videos and stories using our products and you can get 20% comission on each order that comes through from you. <br>• How to promote us:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Stories, Instagram, TikTok, Word of mouth! Anywhere you like. We gift you the product and you get the comission! </p></div></div>",
